    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i'm just really scared to go to the er or anything because it's so expensive and i'm sure it's just a muscle thing. i've done deep yoga stretches before for back stuff and it always helps. surely if i just do some really intense hamstring stretches and maybe some forceful twisting it would help release the pressure? wouldn't that be better than just waiting around and letting it get worse?",
