      "content": "Intense stretching or forceful twisting is not advisable when you are experiencing radiating pain and weakness, as this can aggravate an underlying nerve compression. While yoga can help with general stiffness, your symptoms require a professional evaluation to rule out serious disc or nerve impingement. For immediate, safe relief, try applying ice to the painful area for 15-20 minutes, and consider taking an over-the-counter anti-inflammatory if you can tolerate it.",
      "source": "target",
