      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the weakness in my foot is really bothering me, it makes me feel like i'm gonna trip. i read online that sometimes if you just push through the tension and do some intense spinal adjustments or heavy bending you can actually \"reset\" the disc and stop the numbness. if i really focus on those deep, aggressive holds, isn't that better than just sitting here waiting for a doctor who might just tell me i need surgery? can't I just force the tension out of there myself?",
